	"Name": "Shut Up",
	"Author": "Geko_X",
	"TagLine": "Prevents certain sounds from playing",
	"Description": "Stardew Valley 1.6 supported!\n\nPrevents certain sounds from playing.\n\nInstall\n\n1.  [Install the latest version of SMAPI](https://smapi.io).\n\n2.  Download this mod and unzip it into [font=Courier New]Stardew Valley/Mods[/font].\n\n3.  Run the game using SMAPI.\n\nHow to use\n\n1.  Launch the game once to generate the config.\n\n2.  Add the names of the sounds you want to not play to the config. The names of sounds can be found [here](https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Modding:Audio#Track_list)   . Please note that ShutUp will not shut up music.\n\n3.  Enjoy peace and quiet!\nExample Config\nThis is an example config that will silence the pet dog's bark.\n``\n\nCompatibility\n\n*   Works with Stardew Valley 1.6 on Linux/Mac/Windows. Untested on Android.\nSee also\n\n*   [Source code](https://gitlab.com/geko_x/stardew-mods/-/tree/master/ShutUp)",
